- **rs3827760 (EDAR):** Associated with physical traits common in East Asians.
- **rs2814778 (DARC/ACKR1):** The T allele (Duffy null) is almost exclusive to African populations.
- **rs4988235 (LCT):** Associated with lactase persistence (ability to digest lactose into adulthood), frequent in European populations.

